{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57178","headline":"大乘赞十首 八 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间几许痴人，将道复欲求道。\n广寻诸义纷纭，自救己身不了。\n专寻他文乱说，自称至理妙好。\n徒劳一生虚过，永劫沈沦生老。\n浊爱缠心不舍，清净智心自恼。\n真如法界丛林，返作荆棘荒草。\n但执黄叶爲金，不悟弃金求宝。\n所以失念狂走，强力装持相好。\n口内诵经诵论，心里寻常枯槁。\n一朝觉本心空，具足真如不少。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}